{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Wolf Night</strong>, you play a rookie cop trapped in a neon\u2011soaked nightmare as monsters tear through Key City. Outgunned and outnumbered, you\u2019ll fight through rain\u2011slicked streets, speeding trains, and burning highways \u2014 and decide whether to control the beast inside you\u2026 or let it loose.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brutal, Stylish 2D Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut through monstrosities using firearms, melee weapons, and devastating supernatural abilities.<br>Slow time.<br>Howl enemies back.<br>Rip through hordes with feral power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast. Punchy. Unforgiving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584550/extras/78e0cfcceb48bc8b93cfa241b774b30e.poster.avif?t=1771043484\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584550/extras/78e0cfcceb48bc8b93cfa241b774b30e.webm?t=1771043484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584550/extras/78e0cfcceb48bc8b93cfa241b774b30e.mp4?t=1771043484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A City Worth Fighting For</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore rain\u2011drenched streets, shattered downtown districts, speeding trains, and hidden corners of Key City.<br>Meet survivors. Protect them \u2014 or prioritize your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision leaves a mark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584550/extras/a6d6576a594d3be2a24972de6acc0c69.poster.avif?t=1771043484\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584550/extras/a6d6576a594d3be2a24972de6acc0c69.webm?t=1771043484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584550/extras/a6d6576a594d3be2a24972de6acc0c69.mp4?t=1771043484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be warned, giving into your animalistic instincts can be the difference between saving this city, or becoming a monster yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584550/extras/38cda5a238a4b925cb9a1c5e2365f0b1.poster.avif?t=1771043484\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584550/extras/38cda5a238a4b925cb9a1c5e2365f0b1.webm?t=1771043484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584550/extras/38cda5a238a4b925cb9a1c5e2365f0b1.mp4?t=1771043484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3584550?t=1771043484","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584550/cad1581d5235256d57dcb4f2a8d0d83603324f74/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771043484","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584550/a41da731079e4dc732174d41e3d31c1e02d24fc0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771043484","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584550/a41da731079e4dc732174d41e3d31c1e02d24fc0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771043484","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{